<p>Jab Chali Talwar Haye Zehar Mein Dobi Hoi.<br> Sar Shikasta Ho Gaya Uth Na Sakay Maula Ali.<br> They Sirhaney Shabar-o-Shabeer Our Abbas Bhi. Baap Ko Jab Betiyon Ki Yaad Tarpaney Lagi.<br> <br> Dekh Kar Beton Ka Chehra Yeh Ali Kehne Lagay. Waqt Kam Hai Betiyon Ke Pas Le Jao Mujhe.<br> <br> Dekh Kar Zainab Ko Meri Sans Mein Sans Aaye Gi. Dekh Kar Kulsoom Ko Yeh Zindagi Barh Jaye Gi.<br> Baap Kuch Din Our Jee Le Betiyon Ke Samne.<br> <br> Zakhm Zarbat Ka Wahan Yeh Dekhna Zahir Na Ho. Khon Sar Se Saaf Kar Ke Phir Amama Bandh Do. Betiyaan Ghabra Na Jaein Meri Halat Dekh Ke.<br> <br> Haye Phir Shabeer Se Rotay Hoye Bolay Ali.<br> Woh Agar Mangay Tu De Dena Nishani Baap Ki.<br> Yeh Musalla Sath Rakh Lo Meri Zainab Ke Liye.<br> <br> Iss Liye Hi Baap Se Beti Ka Hai Rishta Hai Ajab. Betiyaan Hain Baap Ki Maiyyat Pe Ronaq Ka Sabab. Khush Naseebi Hai Khuda Beti Atta Kar De Jisay.<br> <br> Apne Baba Ke Janazay Par Jo Roein Fatima.<br> Oss Ghari Main Apni Zainab Ke Liye Rota Raha.<br> Kitna Mushkil Hai Bicharna Betiyon Ka Baap Se.<br> <br> Kal Main Jab Kulsoom Ke Ghar Se Chala Roney Lagi. Mere Seene Se Lipat Kar Mujh Se Yeh Kehne Lagi.<br> Ja Rahe Hain Laut Kar Phir Aaeingay Kab Ghar Mere.<br> <br> Le Chalo Ab Betiyon Se Door Main Kaisay Rahon. Zainab-o-Kulsoom Ke Ja Kar Main Shaney Chom Loon.<br> Haan Issi Kofay Mein Hoon Gay Hath Dono Ke Bandhay.<br> <br> Dekh Kar Abbas Ka Chehra Ali Ne Yeh Kaha.<br> Samne Rehna Hamesha Orh Kar Meri Abba. Betiyaan Jeeti Rahein Chehra Tumhara Dekh Ke.<br> <br> Haye :ZEESHAN:-o-:RAZA: Jab Hukam Baba Ka Suna. Ghar Ki Janib Le Chaley Betay Basad Aah-o-Baqa. Our Ali Beton Se Ro Ro Kar Yehi Kehte Rahe.</p>